Alembic migrations for the `ai` schema (owned by fluent-ai).

Generate a revision:
    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

Apply migrations:
    uv run alembic upgrade head

Downgrade one revision:
    uv run alembic downgrade -1

Configuration:
    alembic.ini at the repo root points here.
    env.py resolves the DB URL from the environment (MIGRATIONS_DATABASE_URL,
    falling back to DATABASE_URL) — no other app settings are required.
    Target metadata is OwnedBase only — never touches public/pgboss/drizzle.
